   - For relay2 (HS2/RJ45 Pin 6/ESP D5), connect GPIO pin 14 to the NO (Normally Open) terminal of the relay module and GND to the COM (Common) terminal.
   - For relay1 (HS1/RJ45 Pin 7/ESP D6), connect GPIO pin 12 to the NO terminal of the relay module and GND to the COM terminal.
   - For relay0 (HS0/RJ45 Pin 8/ESP D7), connect GPIO pin 13 to the NO terminal of the relay module and GND to the COM terminal.

